{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_st02",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_st02",
  "title": "權與力",
  "storyCode": "NL-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4aa196706af5bdd55b9185868a4c687935fa5894449b2be2fa8c3c2c147be686",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "text": "......博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "text": "您從餐廳回來之後，就一直緊鎖著眉頭哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "text": "如果感到疲憊的話，我可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你怎麼看待今天這場晚宴？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "text": "很得體，博士。看來您已經習慣這類交際了？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "text": "看得出，雖然常務董事沒有親自露面，但那些企業高管都對您青睞有加......"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你覺得，馬克維茨是個怎樣的人？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "text": "......如我之前對您說的，因為耀騎士的事件，有一位發言人引咎辭職。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "text": "馬克維茨是臨時頂上這個位置的，在此之前，他只是一個默默無聞的小角色......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "text": "雖然他的身上還保留有一些未經洗禮的人情味......不過在現在這個環境，能持續多久可說不太好。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你認為羅德島的計畫，有可行性嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
          "text": "先不提這個......您真的信任我嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
          "text": "聯合會的滲透並非某種組織形式上的滲透......在金錢和確實發生改變的社會面前，即使聯合會什麼也不做，騎士也會倒向資本。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "礫",
          "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
          "text": "監正會對羅德島禮遇的原因幾乎和耀騎士密不可分。即使如此，您這樣縝密的人......如果不小心對待監正會，是會吃虧的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "感謝你的提醒。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "這我當然知道。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那麼，能告訴我你的意見嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "所以你的意見是？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......鏽銅騎士......又，復賽了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "企業員工",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
          "text": "是的......畢竟騎士協會根據錄影和其他騎士的證詞，向國民院證明那位感染者不過是自己過度施法導致的疾病惡化。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "企業員工",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
          "text": "死因也是“礦石病”，鏽銅騎士並沒有直接責任，所以......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......就算這是真的......那難道我們就該......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "你先出去吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "企業員工",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
          "text": "好的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......撥通國民院副審官的......私人電話。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......發言人閣下，您想出結果了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "只要恰爾內先生不再掌握證據，就可以了，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "當然......可是我得提醒您，如果事後暴露了，你我都難辭其咎。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "所以，殺死他，是最安全的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "我向您保證。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "保證我確實......可以堵住恰爾內先生的嘴。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "具體手段，您就不要過問了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "好吧......如果您能拿出誠意的話。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "明天我就會著手重審奧爾默·英格拉的案件，在七天之內，只要您能給我一個足夠有誠意的答案......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "奧爾默·英格拉就會從此消失在騎士競技之中。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......誠意。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "是的。至少，您得向我證明恰爾內先生“確實永遠不會背叛”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......我想您應該明白一件事情......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "您是在挑釁一位發言人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "您和我心裡都明白，我只是臨危受命，我在董事會裡並沒有靠山。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "但這不代表，我會任您宰割。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "無胄盟的指揮權......曾在恰爾內先生手裡。那麼現在......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......請您不要誤會，我並不是在挑戰您的權力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "我只是提醒您，確保我們日後的合作順暢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "既然您這麼說了，那麼我也不好咄咄相逼。這確實不太禮貌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "只要您做擔保就行。奧爾默·英格拉說到底只是一個腐朽貴族，他不值得我們傷了感情，您說是吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......沒錯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "那麼，我們似乎沒什麼好聊的了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "——！馬克維茨先生，請等——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "............"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
          "text": "......你笑了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......！麥基先生，您什麼時候......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
          "text": "我從沒見過你露出那樣的笑容，馬克維茨兄。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "您有什麼事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
          "text": "當然，無胄盟的命令已經正式下達，你我還是和這件事有一些關係的。不過......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
          "text": "......算了，沒什麼。繼續工作吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
          "text": "......好，麥基先生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
          "text": "權力永遠令人甘之如飴，是吧，馬克維茨。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "......晚上的街道還真是適合散步。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "如果不用工作的話。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
          "text": "報告，莫妮克閣下已經帶隊到達指定地點。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
          "text": "本次行動目標已經明確，現在藏身於這塊地區的感染者，約莫在百人左右。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "啊，能殺就殺吧，上頭說了，按數量算錢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "老規矩，不許對自己人動手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
          "text": "是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士A",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "喂、喂！我聽說有人看見無胄盟了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士B",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "什、什麼......不會吧，這裡可是卡瓦萊利亞基的中心！他們敢大開殺戒嗎！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
          "text": "......太少了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
          "text": "什麼，野鬃不是如你們所願吸引了無胄盟的注意嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
          "text": "但是，數量太少了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
          "text": "是我們看漏了嗎......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
          "text": "做好最壞的準備，遠牙。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
          "text": "不要低估無胄盟。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士A",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "快，快走！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士B",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "冷靜點，你看到了什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士A",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "青、青、青色的長弓......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士A",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "啊、啊！？開他娘什麼玩笑！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士A",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "快，快告訴其他人，分頭跑，躲回垃圾場裡都沒事！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士A",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "讓那些普通感染者不要反抗，千萬不要反抗——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士B",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "現、現、現在誰能聯繫到紅松騎士團......快......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "......哼哼哼......哼哼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
          "text": "報告，發現三名感染者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "哼哼哼......哼哼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "對了，我有提過董事會的報價嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "一個非法感染者三百枚金幣，感染者騎士翻倍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
          "text": "別跑！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "......該死！被發現了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "......一個感染者值一張特錦賽門票。一個感染者騎士值半輛好車。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "那麼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "一個報價單之外的特殊人物，我們該怎麼處理呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
          "text": "呃？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "你們接受了幾種手勢暗語的訓練？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
          "text": "啊，我記得好像是三套暗語......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "嗯，算了，都忘了吧，如果你們看見我......嗯......打響指的動作。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "看見我打響指的話，就立刻行動，別猶豫。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
          "text": "是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "好啦，我上去打聲招呼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "晚上好，一個美好的夜晚，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "打擾您看報了嗎？今天的晚報可全是耀騎士的新聞。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "這附近一個人都沒有，真冷清，聽說這裡最近可不太平......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "咳。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "您一個人在這裡做什麼?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "羅伊......我剛結束工作，只是在這裡小憩片刻。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "哎呀，原來您才下班啊，這個時間？您還怪辛苦的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "不過......您在這裡有什麼工作？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "這附近應該只有感染者、非法移民和黑市販子才對吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "只是在等人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "怎麼，你連我等的是誰都要問嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "不，不，不，怎麼會呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "等人......嗯，等人。難道是在等一位美麗的女性嗎？哈哈，開個玩笑......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "但我們是有公務在身的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "得麻煩您和您的朋友，回避一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......你辦你的事，我辦我的事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "你明白自己在說什麼吧，瑪恩納。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "難道我剛才是在用高盧語說話嗎。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "......別這麼說話嘛，您在這裡，我手下那些人可會因為緊張而失誤的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "唉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "......瑪恩納，你知道......如果現在我要殺你......得費多少功夫嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "羅伊緩緩抬起了手。\n暗處，無胄盟的刺客已經蓄勢待發。\n也許只是錯覺，這些深藏不露的隱秘大師，總感覺自己被一覽無餘。\n瑪恩納·臨光。\n他們開始祈禱，祈禱羅伊不要發出任何的信號——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "白角持劍的薩卡茲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "............哈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "還真是一位......美麗的女性呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我來晚了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......看我做什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你該去工作了，羅伊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": ".........嗯......"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "羅伊的視線與薩卡茲相交片刻。\n他在思考一件事情。\n一會該怎麼開溜，才不至於太過丟臉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "哈哈，剛才我突然改變了想法。你看，好像後半夜要下雨，我可沒帶傘。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "不過......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅伊",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
          "text": "臨光家族試圖袒護感染者，我可以這麼認為嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "請便。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......您......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "瑪嘉烈又獲勝了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "你應該阻止她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......很抱歉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "如果這是她想要做的，那麼我會支持她......我會成為她的支柱。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "......你？一個薩卡茲......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "感染者的事情，我就當已經通知過羅德島了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "感謝您出手相助......無胄盟，是個強敵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "如果他執意要殺死躲藏在這附近的所有感染者，我想我們沒有辦法阻止。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "......我只是坐在這罷了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "僅此而已。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......如果您想知道瑪嘉烈這幾年所遭遇的，我願意把我知道的都告訴您。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "當然，如果您願意親口問她的話......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "......我不關心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "看到她的眼神，我就已經明白了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "她的父親母親，甚至是過去的我，誰都擁抱過那樣流光溢彩的時代。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......您......確實是她真正的家人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "......你已經知道了該知道的，這之後，我不會再干預半分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "你可以告訴瑪嘉烈，告訴那個......“羅德島”。告訴他們，大騎士領光鮮的外表下，腐爛到了什麼地步。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "但更切實際的建議是，早日離開大騎士領，離開卡西米爾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
          "text": "盡力逃離這個時代吧，這才是每個人為數不多的正確選擇。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......真是個複雜的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "你......別過來！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "該死的，你是無胄盟嗎？你——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "不、不對，你是薩卡茲！？你是誰？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "我沒有敵意，無胄盟已經離開了這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "你、你在說什麼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者難民",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
          "text": "......剛才，剛才這個薩卡茲攔在了那些無胄盟面前......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者難民",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
          "text": "你是什麼人？你怎麼敢和無胄盟作對......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......我是感染者醫師。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "一個薩卡茲，自稱感染者醫師？這......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者難民",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
          "text": "......這也太假了......我反而覺得她沒有在騙我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "好吧......那你打算做什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "卡西米爾有提供感染者醫療的手段......既然如此，為什麼你們還會躲藏在這裡？在這座城市的夾縫中......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "......你不是卡西米爾人？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "不，說不定大部分卡西米爾人都不知道......慢著，你說你是感染者醫師......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "你、你是零號地塊的......！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "我來自一家醫療企業，你們說的零號地塊......是指感染者收容地區嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "監正會出資建立了檢查並治療感染者騎士的收容治療中心......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "閃靈沒有急著繼續說下去。\n她從面前的感染者眼裡看到了疑惑、對自己的不信任、恐懼，以及絲毫的期許。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "......你真的......不是卡西米爾人，也對，他們是很討厭薩卡茲的，呃，抱歉，但事實如此。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "......你在那裡治療過感染者嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "是的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "你難道不感到奇怪嗎......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "那麼大一個移動平台，幾乎成了感染者騎士的牢籠......你知道吧，感染者騎士在那裡接受檢查、治療，同時也在那裡“生活”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "如果那種狀態能被稱為“生活”的話。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "好，看來你們這些外來者連這件事都不清楚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "但如果把所有的感染者都集中在那裡生活......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "地方不夠，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "還能賺錢的感染者，會重新走上賽場，或是繼續進行一些......勞務工作，什麼樣的都有。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "還有些當不上騎士的，會像奴隸一樣被派去做一些黑工......礦工，搬運工，而且都是危險的環境。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "而如果受了傷，連這些基本的工作都做不了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "......你猜猜看，外鄉人，你猜猜看那些感染者都從零號地塊去哪了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "你們以為那裡是醫院，騎士們覺得那裡是一座監獄。但我告訴你，都不是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "感染者被送去那裡，洗乾淨尊嚴，剝下價值，最後送上砧板，任人宰割。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
          "text": "那是一座漂亮的屠宰場，薩卡茲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
